Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 16:13:12

Added. Bluetooth Pairing is an app of the Bazzite Console Suite (owner, 14-11-2026), in the portal's Utilities tab:
it pairs your Bluetooth keyboard, mouse and controllers at boot, shows PlayStation controller batteries in the
Bluetooth icon and has Plasma switch Bluetooth on at every login. Its installer has its test,
tools/installer-tests/btpair.sh, and the wiki its chapter.
